    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Impersonal constructions",
     "texto": [
      "**Można + infinitive** expresses permission or possibility; **trzeba + infinitive**, necessity; **nie wolno + infinitive**, prohibition.",
      "These constructions do not change according to who carries out the action. Polish can leave out the person if it is not important."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
